      "en": "Create an n8n workflow starting with a Webhook node (POST) and copy its Test URL. From Python: `requests.post(url, json=data, timeout=15)`. The data arrives in `$json.body`. Use this so your script (after heavy work like analysing Excel) hands the result to n8n to spread across Sheets, Slack and email. Put a secret in a header and have the Webhook check it (Header Auth)."
